diff --git a/docs/spec/position.md b/docs/spec/position.md
index 0894e60..397f1aa 100644
--- a/docs/spec/position.md
+++ b/docs/spec/position.md
@@ -76,7 +76,8 @@ the GPS driver's task, readers are the radio, UI and debug link tasks. Each read
 
 `position_gps()` gives the UI the board GPS as it is now: false while Settings > Location > GPS is off or no valid
 sentence came for 60 s, else the last fix (60 s old at most), satellites used and HDOP (GGA), speed, course and time
-(RMC).
+(RMC). The board's speed and course expire from the Position screen independently of the position, since GGA
+has no motion fields. A lost fix or switching GPS off discards these measurements until the next valid RMC.
 
 With `CONFIG_GPS_SKY`, `nmea_sky.c` also reads the board GPS's satellite sentences:
 
